1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Hans Thorersen Grevegg (Thorer Gulbrandsen , Gulbrand Larsen ) was born 1739 in Grevegg, Trøgstad. He died 1 1808 in Igsi, Hobøl and was buried 2 17 Jan 1808 in Hobøl kirke, Østfold.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hans married (1) Malena Kniple.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 57 F i Jørran Hansdatter was born 1 1759 in Hov, Spydeberg and was christened 2 20 May 1759 in Spydeberg kirke, Østfold.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hans also married 1 (2) Maren Hansdatter Igsi, daughter of Hans Tostensen Igsi and Ragnild Tostensdatter Igsi, on 6 Jan 1764 in Tomter kirke, Hobøl, Østfold. Maren was born 2 1745 in Elverud, Hobøl and was christened 3 25 Jul 1745
2 CONC  in Tomter kirke, Hobøl, Østfold. She died 4 1813 in Igsi, Hobøl and was buried 5 31 Aug 1813 in Tomter kirke, Hobøl, Østfold.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT + 58 M ii Thorer Hansen Bøler + 59 M iii Hans Hansen Kiserud 60 M iv Tosten Hansen Igsi was born 1 1769 in Hauger, Spydeberg and was christened 2 23 Jul 1869 in Spydeberg kirke, Østfold. He died 3 3 May 1856 in Igsi, Hobøl and was
2 CONC  buried 4 14 May 1856 in Hobøl kirke, Østfold. + 61 M v Lars Hansen Houger 62 F vi Martha Hansdatter Houger was born 1 1774 in Hauger, Spydeberg and was christened 2 10 Dec 1774 in Spydeberg kirke, Østfold. + 63 F vii Margrethe Ha
2 CONC nsdatter Igsi + 64 F viii Ragnil Hansdatter Igsi + 65 M ix Anders Hansen Skjellfoss + 66 M x Johannes Hansen Bovim
