1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Else is the daughter of Christen Christophersen Morbach (Gundeng)<br/>
2 CONT ^ Not possible, since he was "trolovet" with Olaug in [https://www.digitalarkivet.no/view/327/pv00000002273684 1768], [https://www.digitalarkivet.no/kb20061018030389 kirkeboka], and Else got married in [https://www.digitalarkivet.
2 CONC no/view/327/pv00000002273405 1760], [https://www.digitalarkivet.no/kb20061018030385 kirkeboka]. If he was married to someone else before Olaug, or even fathered her outside of marriage, he could still be her father. I noted that I
2 CONC var Gunneng is a witness at both marriages. She must have been born before the church books started, so that makes her a likely daughter of Christopher, who died 1731.
2 CONT
2 CONT NOT found born as a daughter of Christen Larsen (Sogaard) & Maria Christophersdatter Morbach (Gundeng). - Written Else Gundeng at marriage INDICATING daughter of (Maria's brother) Christen Christophersen Morbach (Gundeng).
2 CONT
