1 NAME Peder Andersen /Eng/
2 GIVN Peder Andersen
2 _MARNM Eng
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1650
2 ADDR
3 CITY Degernes
3 STAE Ostfold
3 CTRY Norway
