1 NOTE Witnesses at her baptism were: Amund Strøm, Erik Strom, Lars Strøm, Marthe
2 CONT Strøm and Anne Slevigen. Most of the data for Ingri descendants has come from
2 CONT two family genealogy books found in Norway and talking to two descendants who
2 CONT live in Rakkestad. The books failed, in most cases, to cite birth, baptism,
2 CONT marriage places and death date and burial locations. Because the
2 CONT histories refer mostly to people from Rakkestad and Degernes one can assume
2 CONT that is where events happened. Rakkestad & Degernes are now Rakkestad Kommune.
